      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "-SNf3ZOciphKIPqG3K8d9",
      "originalText": "runtime.mstart\n初始化 M0 后进入调度",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ao",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HZ2YgwSZge8HPR0C7f9_-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3116.656133112865,
      "y": 152.7250810216899,
      "width": 322.03350830078125,
      "height": 157.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "tekDuZBB-HBPQx3kTBnYj"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 500450497,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 454262731,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785255040029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Go 1.26 队列与调度要点\n\n1. p.runq 固定容量 256，另有一个 p.runnext\n2. 本地队列满时，部分 G 转移到 sched.runq\n3. p.schedtick % 61 == 0 时优先检查全局队列\n4. Work Stealing 通常偷取 victim P 可运行 G 的一半\n5. sysmon 以约 10ms 尺度检查长时间运行的 G\n6. M 数量可多于 P，syscall / cgo 阻塞时尤为常见\n7. 默认 GOMAXPROCS 可由 sysmon 周期性重新计算",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Tk7m_0flsm3OdTcGiVgOX",
      "originalText": "Go 1.26 队列与调度要点\n\n1. p.runq 固定容量 256，另有一个 p.runnext\n2. 本地队列满时，部分 G 转移到 sched.runq\n3. p.schedtick % 61 == 0 时优先检查全局队列\n4. Work Stealing 通常偷取 victim P 可运行 G 的一半\n5. sysmon 以约 10ms 尺度检查长时间运行的 G\n6. M 数量可多于 P，syscall / cgo 阻塞时尤为常见\n7. 默认 GOMAXPROCS 可由 sysmon 周期性重新计算",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ap",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2i9cLN4qEmsW3WStRmFPR",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": -202.37064067097936,
      "y": 80.66456346089944,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 110,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
