      "seed": 7674913,
      "version": 249,
      "versionNonce": 726385227,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785255040029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Go 1.26 源码依据\n\n• runtime/asm_amd64.s：rt0_go 启动汇编\n• runtime/proc.go：schedinit、procresize、newproc、mstart、schedule\n• runtime/runtime2.go：g、m、p、schedt 与 G/P 状态\n• runtime/debug.go：容器感知的默认 GOMAXPROCS\n• runtime/netpoll.go：网络轮询与 G 唤醒\n• runtime/time.go：timer",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "VUWTwksyfJyh3X3aP-vv8",
      "originalText": "Go 1.26 源码依据\n\n• runtime/asm_amd64.s：rt0_go 启动汇编\n• runtime/proc.go：schedinit、procresize、newproc、mstart、schedule\n• runtime/runtime2.go：g、m、p、schedt 与 G/P 状态\n• runtime/debug.go：容器感知的默认 GOMAXPROCS\n• runtime/netpoll.go：网络轮询与 G 唤醒\n• runtime/time.go：timer",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1y",
      "autoResize": true
    },
